{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:755","content":{"id":755,"title":"番茄专注","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"支持创建番茄钟来帮助保持专注"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3bad9954-8e0b-415a-8c2e-9c241cdc44df.webp","uuid":"ec0d6af3-b654-4979-b4cd-40786735fa48","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_3bad9954-8e0b-415a-8c2e-9c241cdc44df.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"番茄钟有两种模式，一种是倒计时，比如 25 分钟，时间到了番茄钟计时结束，进入休息。另一种是正计时，只负责记录时间，需要手动结束。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"red","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我觉得倒计时很容易打断心流，因为做的事情不可能正好就结束了，所以我更喜欢正计时，番茄钟是一种让我们进入专注态的信号，其时间我觉得并不重要。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"进入计时后在左下角有一个计时条"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b7e9f4f9-41c8-45c6-9547-f85eb02bb3f1.webp","uuid":"69594f73-8366-4514-9e6b-3106a31f8c86","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b7e9f4f9-41c8-45c6-9547-f85eb02bb3f1.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"此时可以离开这个页面，计时会在后台进行。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在计时的状态下，可以在右上角选择打开小窗或者沉浸式窗口"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0dae2223-5fef-4e6c-b234-e599661d9dd4.webp","uuid":"86834b3b-9eea-4d60-bac7-b3444ac44723","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0dae2223-5fef-4e6c-b234-e599661d9dd4.webp","width":445.49094891726463},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"小窗样式"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_f7f2a5ac-8cc9-4d3f-8573-54fbc9dbb609.webp","uuid":"1110f1b9-e54c-4d74-863e-18ac6bf882b6","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_f7f2a5ac-8cc9-4d3f-8573-54fbc9dbb609.webp","width":179.0918387607094},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"沉浸式窗口样式"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_bfd0005f-1ce3-4123-b723-c8ead4451517.webp","uuid":"de6e10a4-be3d-4675-95ec-6981cdb127a0","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_bfd0005f-1ce3-4123-b723-c8ead4451517.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在计时模式下，软件提供一些白噪声作为背景音"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_cb0fa4b1-dc3b-4d7a-ba08-013c77984525.webp","uuid":"57e4a6e3-ea29-4e0c-ab7c-666cab7af967","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_cb0fa4b1-dc3b-4d7a-ba08-013c77984525.webp","width":720}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"软件使用文档","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:735","type":"doc","id":735}},{"label":"功能模块","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:745","type":"doc","id":745}},{"label":"效率管理","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:757","type":"doc","id":757}},{"label":"番茄专注","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:755","type":"doc","id":755}}],"prevPage":{"title":"任务待办","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:751","type":"doc","id":751}},"nextPage":{"title":"日历","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:752","type":"doc","id":752}},"createTime":1766915808695,"updateTime":1777735175086,"projectId":48},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1777735175086}}